      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "これか。\r\n雷鳴山にあったものと違って、\r\nすべてハッキリと読める状態だな。",
        "official_en": "This looks a lot more legible than what we found on\nMt. Thunderclap.",
        "real_en": "This is it. Unlike the one on Mt. Thunderclap, every part of this inscription is clearly legible."
